<p class="faq-reskin__answer-text">It's a very personal decision, but we suggest shaving your head 2-3 times per week and seeing how that works for you. You can always adjust it later on. This article will help you determine your <a rel="noreferrer noopener" target="_blank" href="{%- for b in section.blocks -%}{%- if b.settings.slot == 's1604' -%}{{ b.settings.link | default: '#' }}{%- endif -%}{%- endfor -%}" data-atl-slot="s1604" style="{%- for b in section.blocks -%}{%- if b.settings.slot == 's1604' -%}{{ b.settings.style }}{%- endif -%}{%- endfor -%}">{%- for b in section.blocks -%}{%- if b.settings.slot == 's1604' -%}{{ b.settings.text | newline_to_br }}{%- endif -%}{%- endfor -%}</a>.</p>
