<p class="faq-reskin__answer-text">After shaving, keeping your scalp moisturized is key. Use a lightweight, alcohol-free moisturizer to prevent dryness and irritation. Since your scalp is now more exposed, don’t forget sunscreen if you’re heading outside. Exfoliating once or twice a week helps prevent ingrown hairs and keeps your skin smooth, but be careful with products that have alcohol or strong fragrances - they can be drying. Want more scalp care tips? Check out this article on <a rel="noreferrer noopener" target="_blank" href="{%- for b in section.blocks -%}{%- if b.settings.slot == 's1626' -%}{{ b.settings.link | default: '#' }}{%- endif -%}{%- endfor -%}" data-atl-slot="s1626" style="{%- for b in section.blocks -%}{%- if b.settings.slot == 's1626' -%}{{ b.settings.style }}{%- endif -%}{%- endfor -%}">{%- for b in section.blocks -%}{%- if b.settings.slot == 's1626' -%}{{ b.settings.text | newline_to_br }}{%- endif -%}{%- endfor -%}</a>.</p>
